--! A test platform's one capability: make every later `child_process.spawn`
--! report an `error` event whose `code` is `toString`, a name every object
--! inherits and no failure Node documents.

--| From now on, every `child_process.spawn` gives a child whose `error`
--| event has code `toString`.
pub foreign impure breakSpawns : ⊤ → ⊤
